      "en": "Gilded Mountains and Seas explores a digital exhibition pavilion through AI-generated art and moving-image design. The project brings the Mountains and Seas theme into a spatial exhibition context, connecting visual world-building with the design of a visitor environment. It received Beijing Second Prize in AI-generated Art at the 18th China Creative Challenges Contest.",
      "zh": "《鎏金山海——东方幻境影像展空间设计》将 AI 生成艺术、动态影像与数字展馆设计相结合，以“山海”主题连接视觉世界建构与观众的空间体验。"
