      "en": "Exploring Tengger develops a digital cultural-tourism concept for a desert destination. My contribution covered planning and visual design, including digital humans, 3D scenes, AIGC imagery and presentation materials, translating the tourism concept into a coherent visual proposal. Our team, Happy Is Enough, received the Beijing Special Prize in the 14th College Student E-commerce Innovation, Creativity and Entrepreneurship Challenge.",
      "zh": "《探秘腾格里》围绕沙漠目的地构建数字文旅方案。个人参与规划和视觉设计，包括数字人、三维场景、AIGC 图像与汇报材料，将文旅构想转化为连贯的视觉提案。"
